+### Recording automatically with Location
+
+Showing your location starts a recording as well, so a flight is recorded even if you forget
+**⏺ Record**. When you hide Location, that recording stops with it:
+
+- a recording that became a flight — at least **5 minutes** long and **1 nm** flown — is saved
+  under *Recordings* like any other;
+- a shorter one (the phone on the desk, a walk to the hangar) is not kept, and a short message
+  says so.
+
+To turn it off, clear **Settings → Record automatically with location** (on by default). Location then
+only shows your position, and nothing is recorded unless you tap **⏺ Record**. A recording you start
+yourself with **⏺ Record** is always saved, however short.
+
+A recording in progress survives a reload or a restart of the app: if its last fix is less than
+30 minutes old it carries on where it was; if it is older, it is saved as it stands and the next
+one starts fresh.
+
